[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5761.79, "timestamp": "01:36:01", "text": "对我来说很重要。就像我一样，就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5764.87, "timestamp": "01:36:04", "text": "不要那样交朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5767.27, "timestamp": "01:36:07", "text": "我非常谨慎，就像我有很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5769.43, "timestamp": "01:36:09", "text": "就像你认识我认识的人，但不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5771.91, "timestamp": "01:36:11", "text": "很多朋友，还有曾经的某个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5774.39, "timestamp": "01:36:14", "text": "对我来说，这变得很重要，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5776.07, "timestamp": "01:36:16", "text": "我为什么很难交到朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5778.39, "timestamp": "01:36:18", "text": "因为就像如果一个人变成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5780.229, "timestamp": "01:36:20", "text": "对我来说，他们的战斗变得很重要，也成为我的战斗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5782.229, "timestamp": "01:36:22", "text": "如果有人招惹他，战斗就会打起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5785.43, "timestamp": "01:36:25", "text": "你，我不会让另一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5786.95, "timestamp": "01:36:26", "text": "我知道，但我会尽力保护你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5789.27, "timestamp": "01:36:29", "text": "任何可能的方式，如果你认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5791.03, "timestamp": "01:36:31", "text": "就像你知道的，尼克前辈，你是我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5791.773, "timestamp": "01:36:31", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "👏👏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5792.629, "timestamp": "01:36:32", "text": "朋友对，如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5795.189, "timestamp": "01:36:35", "text": "他们虐待你，你甚至都不能这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5796.95, "timestamp": "01:36:36", "text": "看到它，是因为你们是如此要好的朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5799.91, "timestamp": "01:36:39", "text": "和他们在一起，我最终会变得不喜欢他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5801.91, "timestamp": "01:36:41", "text": "那个虐待你的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5804.39, "timestamp": "01:36:44", "text": "因为我不喜欢我的朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5806.229, "timestamp": "01:36:46", "text": "你知道，被那样对待就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5808.31, "timestamp": "01:36:48", "text": "当然，我没什么好说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5809.669, "timestamp": "01:36:49", "text": "但是，如果你关心那个人的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5812.07, "timestamp": "01:36:52", "text": "我只会说，好吧，我明白了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5814.07, "timestamp": "01:36:54", "text": "我内心会想：不，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5817.27, "timestamp": "01:36:57", "text": "你知道，别那样对待我的朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5818.59, "timestamp": "01:36:58", "text": "好的"}]